<div class="legal-page-container">
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="legal-title">Shipping Policy</h1>
    <div class="legal-content">
      <p>At <strong>Seravolve</strong>, we are committed to delivering your skincare orders quickly, securely, and transparently. We proudly offer <strong>Free Standard Shipping</strong> across India with no minimum purchase requirement.</p>

      <h2>Shipping Rates & Costs</h2>
      <p>Shipping is completely <strong>Free of charge</strong> on all orders nationwide across India. There are no hidden fees, customs charges, or packaging surcharges at checkout.</p>

      <h2>Order Processing & Dispatch</h2>
      <p>All orders are verified, packaged, and dispatched from our warehouse within <strong>1&ndash;2 business days</strong> (Monday through Saturday, excluding public holidays). Orders placed on Sundays or national holidays are dispatched on the subsequent business day.</p>

      <h2>Estimated Delivery Timeframes</h2>
      <p>Once dispatched, estimated delivery times across India are as follows:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Tier 1 &amp; Metro Cities (Delhi NCR, Mumbai, Bengaluru, Hyderabad, Chennai, Kolkata, Pune, Ahmedabad):</strong> 2&ndash;4 business days.</li>
        <li><strong>Tier 2 &amp; Tier 3 Cities / Rest of India:</strong> 4&ndash;7 business days.</li>
        <li><strong>Remote / Northeast / Island Territories:</strong> 6&ndash;9 business days.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Trusted Courier &amp; Logistics Partners</h2>
      <p>To ensure safe and reliable delivery, we partner exclusively with India's leading logistics providers:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Delhivery</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Shiprocket</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Blue Dart</strong></li>
        <li><strong>India Post (Speed Post)</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Trusted Local Express Couriers</strong></li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Order Tracking</h2>
      <p>As soon as your package leaves our fulfillment center, you will automatically receive an email and SMS confirmation containing your <strong>AWB (Air Waybill) tracking number</strong> and a direct link to monitor your shipment in real time.</p>

      <h2>Damaged, Lost, or Incomplete Shipments</h2>
      <p>We take full responsibility for your package until it reaches your hands in perfect condition:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Package Marked Delivered But Not Received:</strong> Please notify us within 48 hours at <a href="mailto:info@seravolve.com">info@seravolve.com</a> or <a href="tel:+919978099097">+91 9978099097</a>. We will immediately raise a formal inquiry with the courier partner and resolve or reship within 3 business days.</li>
        <li><strong>Lost in Transit:</strong> If tracking indicates no movement for more than 5 business days or the carrier confirms the parcel is lost, we will immediately send a complimentary replacement or issue a <strong>100% full refund</strong>.</li>
        <li><strong>Incomplete / Missing Items:</strong> If any item from your order is missing from the package, notify us with a photo of the received box and packing slip within 48 hours. We will express-ship the missing product at zero cost.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Contact Information &amp; Corporate Address</h2>
      <p>For any shipping queries, tracking assistance, or delivery concerns, please reach out to our team:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Brand:</strong> Seravolve</li>
        <li><strong>Legal Entity:</strong> Elisense Enterprise LLP</li>
        <li><strong>Physical Registered Address:</strong> 333 Shayona Plaza, Puna-Saroli Junction, BRTS Road, Surat, Gujarat 395010, India</li>
        <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:info@seravolve.com">info@seravolve.com</a></li>
        <li><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:+919978099097">+91 9978099097</a></li>
        <li><strong>Support Hours:</strong> Monday &ndash; Saturday, 10:00 AM &ndash; 6:00 PM IST</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

